Mylinking™ Network Packet Broker ML-NPB-4860 e ts'ehetsa likou tsa 48*10GE / GE SFP+ le ts'ebetso ea software ea mantlha e lumelletsoeng;Phello ea 480Gbps;Ho kenyeletsoa ho pheta-pheta, ho kopanya, ho fetisa, ho sefa ha quintuple, hlooho ea pakete le ho sefa likahare tsa pakete, ho ipapisitse le ts'ebetso ea sefa ea tloaelo ea sebaka se boletsoeng;
processor e tsoetseng pele ea 40G e bohlale ea sephethephethe;Ho fokotsa lipakete tsa data ho latela tlhoko (ho ipapisitse le likou tsa 'mele le melao ea motsoako oa quintuple);Letšoao le nepahetseng la setempe sa linako tsa lipakete;Boitsebiso bo tebileng ba protocol ea kopo le mesebetsi ea morao-rao ea ho theola sephethephethe;MPLS/VXLAN/GRE/GTP encapsulation le ho hlobola;
Mosebetsi oa motheo oa ho hlahloba phallo o kentsoeng;e ts'ehelitse ho lekola sephethephethe sa maano ka nako ea nnete le sephethephethe sa li-interface.Botsa nalane ea nalane ea sephethephethe ea maano le li-interfaces.
16GB DDR3 memori ea boemo ba indasteri, polokelo ea boemo ba indasteri ea 16GB SLC, chassis ea 1U, phepelo ea matla a mabeli a 250W (DC/AC ka boikhethelo).
